  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening SME`s capacities for sustainable and economic apiculture in the Sultanate of Oman</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at strengthening the value chain of Omani honey and empowering of rural beekeepers to access the knowledge, technologies and markets. It will elevate standards of apiculture in Oman and enhance the quality of honey and other honey added value products.</narrative>
